{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 5540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 3219, "text": "Ooh, look at those threads."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 9660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 6000, "text": "$2 ,000 worth of silk covering a million\n-dollar body."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 14400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 11000, "text": "Notice how it accentuates each ripple\nand bulge."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 22040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 18020, "text": "What's the big occasion, Dan? Will you\nname patron of the year at the Pussycat"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 23040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 22040, "text": "Theater?"}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 24900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23820, "text": "Almost is good."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 27760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25300, "text": "I'm invited to a dinner with the Mayor's\nCommittee on Crime."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 30620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28020, "text": "We'll be discussing strategies, making\nsuggestions."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 32320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31320, "text": "Kissing butt."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 37380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 34160, "text": "I prefer to think of them as keisters of\nopportunity."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 41560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 40560, "text": "Hi, guys."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 44460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42140, "text": "Anybody know a cure for hiccups?"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 46640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44880, "text": "Yes, staple your lips together."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 49620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 48620, "text": "That didn't work."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 53860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 51040, "text": "How about pinching your nose and\ncounting backwards from ten?"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 57080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 54600, "text": "Right. What do you think I am, a\nmachine?"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 65459, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64360, "text": "Was that honeymoon, huh?"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 67440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 65760, "text": "Harry, it was fantastic."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 71860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 68300, "text": "In fact, I didn't leave the hotel room\nfor the first 24 hours."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 74380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 73160, "text": "Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 79540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 75900, "text": "And then Amanda finally tracked down a\nlocksmith and they let me out of there."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 83460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 81740, "text": "Well, I'm glad to hear it all worked\nout."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 88380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 83800, "text": "Oh, yeah, yeah. Things are going great,\nconsidering I'm unemployed."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 91440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 89140, "text": "Buddy, what are you worried about? Your\nwife's worth over $5 million."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 93680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92520, "text": "get out of here."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 96260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 94480, "text": "No, he's right, buddy. Yeah?"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 102400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 96880, "text": "Well, still, I think a man should work\nso he can get up in the morning and look"}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 106980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 102400, "text": "at himself in the mirror and say, are my\nears even?"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 113980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 110820, "text": "That's why I've been working all day\nputting together this resume."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 116900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 115540, "text": "On a paper plate?"}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 119100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 117240, "text": "A hundred for a buck and they fly."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 125200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 122600, "text": "Buddy, what do you say we punch this out\non the computer and print it out on"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 125999, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 125200, "text": "real paper?"}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 128340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 126000, "text": "Okay, but the coleslaw's gonna soak\nright through."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 140640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 133680, "text": "I think Bull"}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 141640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 140640, "text": "needs some help."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 143440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 142200, "text": "What are you going to do?"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 146840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 143840, "text": "I'm gonna sneak over there and scare the\nhell out of him."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 149040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 147820, "text": "It never fails."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 207380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 206380, "text": "All rise."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 215540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 213100, "text": "Hello. New hiccup remedy, sir."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 217240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 216240, "text": "Sorry,"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 225340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 221920, "text": "sir. All right, Mac."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 226780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 225680, "text": "Let's get rolling."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 231060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 227180, "text": "Yes, sir. People versus BHK 937."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 238180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 235920, "text": "You're your people mean well, but you're\npreventing me from fulfilling my"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 242100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238180, "text": "mission. I could be home watching roller\nderby. You don't hear me complaining."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 244720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 243700, "text": "Your turn, Mr."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 250000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 245020, "text": "Prosecutor. Yes, sir. The human baked\npotato here was arrested in City Hall"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 252380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 250000, "text": "after threatening two men with this."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 254100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 253060, "text": "A label maker?"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 258740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 255600, "text": "What do you do? Walk up to them, stick\nin their ribs and type out, make my day."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 264200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 261519, "text": "Your Honor, my client was merely trying\nto get in to see the mayor."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 265520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 264520, "text": "And why was that?"}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 268880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 266060, "text": "I'm here to save the world from the\nforces of evil!"}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 273360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 271500, "text": "Well, you can't, so there."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 280260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277140, "text": "V, may I call you V?"}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 281520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 280520, "text": "If you wish."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 285040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281980, "text": "All right, where exactly is it that\nyou're from?"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 286900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 285440, "text": "The year 2097."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 290560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 287540, "text": "Ah, Mac, V is from the future."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 292020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 291020, "text": "Sir?"}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 295770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 292490, "text": "Time travel violates science -based\nrequirement of locally causal space"}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 297570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 295770, "text": "manifolds, making it impossible for\nanyone."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 299670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 298470, "text": "Except maybe the Jetsons."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 305130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 302990, "text": "Surely you have mutants in your century."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 311250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 307510, "text": "Sir, in view of the circumstances,\ndefense would be agreeable to a"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 313530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 311250, "text": "evaluation. Is prosecution agreeable?"}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 315740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313960, "text": "Does a bear drop trow in the woods?"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 319680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 317040, "text": "All right, then, so be it. We'll hold\non, Mr."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 323540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320440, "text": "937, for the cyborgs from the Bellevue\nGalaxy."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 326620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 325000, "text": "Bellevue? Will the mayor be there?"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 329340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 327220, "text": "Yes, and three Abe Lincolns."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 333020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331120, "text": "Well, Harry, here's the resume."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 334900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333800, "text": "Just print it up."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 338360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335540, "text": "Buddy, this paper is designed to be\nseparated."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 342280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339320, "text": "Oh, I thought they were like this to\nhelp you find your way back."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 346199, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 345320, "text": "What do you think?"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 347840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 346200, "text": "Whoa, looks pretty professional."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 349440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348440, "text": "Thanks to Harry."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 353140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 349540, "text": "Although, generally, I prefer to draw\nlittle eyebrows over the O's."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 359480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 355120, "text": "What is this, buddy? It says here you\nspent 1971 on a meditative sabbatical."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 361840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 360200, "text": "Well, Harry dreamed that one up."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 365600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 362360, "text": "Oh, buddy, we couldn't very well tell\npeople that you spent a year trying to"}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 367720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365600, "text": "figure out ways to get Gilligan off the\nisland."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 372100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 370040, "text": "I came up with 10 ,000 ideas."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 375150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 372930, "text": "Ideas like making a bamboo raft?"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 376670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 375510, "text": "Ten thousand and one."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 382330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 377990, "text": "The next thing to do is to copy this and\nthen figure out what kind of job it is"}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 383269, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382330, "text": "you're after."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 386610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383270, "text": "Boy, this reality stuff sure keeps you\nhopping."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 394250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 393250, "text": "Admit it."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 395930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394370, "text": "This arouses you, doesn't it?"}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 406000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 401900, "text": "I can barely restrain myself from\nleaping out of my chair and ravishing"}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 407660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 406000, "text": "right here, you Nordic god."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 411780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 410220, "text": "All right, Mac, what's next?"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 417240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 412300, "text": "Yes, sir. People versus the Montez\nbrothers in a little thing I like to"}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 418240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417240, "text": "assault."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 433880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 430440, "text": "Trust these hiccup remedies are not\ngoing to interfere with your job."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 435300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 434300, "text": "Count on me, sir."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 442520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438880, "text": "Well, he's a tough act to follow. You\nwant to try, Mr. Frosketer? Very well,"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 446700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442560, "text": "sir. The defendants were arrested after\nassaulting several Bulgarian tourists on"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 447700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446700, "text": "a subway car."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 449780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 447900, "text": "Hey, we were just asking for spare\nchange."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 451600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450080, "text": "But there was a language barrier."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 456620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 453000, "text": "But fortunately for them, they brought\nalong a translator."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 460500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 458480, "text": "Did you ever try to conjugate a\nBulgarian verb?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 467860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 464460, "text": "I take it, Miss Sullivan, that your\ndefendants are pleading not guilty?"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 471480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468220, "text": "Yes, sir. And we asked that in\nconsidering bail you remember that"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 473440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 471480, "text": "gravity of the charges, they are still\njust boys."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 477700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474020, "text": "Oh, just boys? Well, that explains this.\nThen they were just playing pin the"}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 478780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 477700, "text": "shiv on the tourists."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 484160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 480400, "text": "Your Honor, these vermin do not deserve\none shred of pity, compassion, or"}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 485160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 484160, "text": "leniency."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 489030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 487290, "text": "But what the hey, I say let him go."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 493870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491790, "text": "To what he says, Judge. Oh, he cut him."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 495990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 494130, "text": "I can pick him off clean from here, sir."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 497610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 496610, "text": "Without hitting Dan?"}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 499810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 498030, "text": "Oh, well, if you're going to tie my\nhand."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 506190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 503230, "text": "Judge, tell the guards to hand over\ntheir guns."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 507710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 506710, "text": "No!"}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 512150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 508950, "text": "The criminals must be eliminated for the\nfuture of the planet."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 515770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 513049, "text": "Oh, come on. Nobody buys this future\nstuff."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 525500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523440, "text": "Who do you like in the 98 Super Bowl?"}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 533960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529180, "text": "What the hell is that?"}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 536820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 534440, "text": "Just a little wake -up call from the\n21st century."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 540560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538060, "text": "Ron, you don't suppose this guy is\nreally from the future?"}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 543660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541260, "text": "If he is, we're in for a fashion\nnightmare."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 549780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 546840, "text": "V, why are you doing this?"}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 551080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 550080, "text": "It's my mission."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 556040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553900, "text": "Can't be satisfied just wallowing babies\nwith your laser?"}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 559360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 557720, "text": "Not while the scum live."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 563340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 559580, "text": "No! You can't shoot that thing in here.\nInnocent people will be hurt."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 564980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563980, "text": "All right."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 566800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 565580, "text": "The innocent may exit."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 568360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567360, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 573160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 570760, "text": "I want you all to leave in an orderly\nfashion."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 578100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 573500, "text": "The elderly and infirmed first, then\nwomen, then finally able -bodied men."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 594360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 592940, "text": "Chill out, foil man."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 603160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 597160, "text": "Do me a favor. Have the decency, if you\nhit the suit, to finish me off."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 608220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 605760, "text": "Listen, V, excuse me for a minute. Why?"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 609740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608460, "text": "I gotta go to the bathroom."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 611420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 610420, "text": "What?"}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 614620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 611520, "text": "Matt, Roz, don't you feel the urge to\ngo, too?"}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 618160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 615260, "text": "Uh, yeah, I guess we do. Right, Roz?"}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 620380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 618660, "text": "We were hoping you would ask."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 624560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 623560, "text": "Do I have to go, too, sir?"}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 626340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 625280, "text": "No, you don't."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 628320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 626820, "text": "You always know before I do."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 634220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631320, "text": "You want to stay here and entertain our\nfriends."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 641420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 636860, "text": "So, V, how long can you stay fresh in\nthat suit?"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 647350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 644490, "text": "Okay, there's no time to spare. Mac, you\ncall the SWAT team and check to see if"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 649370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 647350, "text": "VHK 937 is a known alias."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 652610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 649590, "text": "And, Roz, you check the local mental\nhospitals and see if they're missing any"}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 653890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 652610, "text": "patients with a laser gun."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 658270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 656210, "text": "Well, don't just stand there, guys. Get\nmoving."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 665010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 659970, "text": "Hey, Harry, I got my resume copy, and I\ncame up with some job ideas. No, no, not"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 669470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 665010, "text": "now, buddy, not now. Dan is being held\ncaptive by two punks with a knife, and"}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 673450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 669470, "text": "they're all being held hostage by a man\nfrom the future with a laser gun."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 675220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 674099, "text": "Okay, then maybe later."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 681080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 680080, "text": "So how's it going?"}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 682159, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 681200, "text": "He set a deadline."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 685700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 682160, "text": "If they don't release your friend in 96\nbillion oscillations of the mercury"}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 687560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685700, "text": "atom, I'm vaporizing the whole bunch."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 690800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 688320, "text": "96 billion oscillations? How long is\nthat?"}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 694260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 691100, "text": "I don't know. When I asked him, he went\non a tirade about the lousy educational"}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 695260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 694260, "text": "system."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 700200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 697420, "text": "V, you'd vaporize them all, even Dan?"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 701800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 700640, "text": "A regrettable necessity."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 705220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 702660, "text": "But... They must be dealt with."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 710080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 705520, "text": "They are loathsome, grotesque creatures\nwho prey on the citizens of this city."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 711440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 710440, "text": "Salt your mother."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 717400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 714800, "text": "V, wait a minute. I'm on your side,\nremember?"}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 719420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 717620, "text": "I was trying to put away these yo -yos."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 721420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 720260, "text": "Yo -yos?"}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 725140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722420, "text": "Legal shorthand for men of honor."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 727240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 725580, "text": "Muy macho."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 732040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 729040, "text": "Hey, man. You think I don't know how to\nuse this?"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 755050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 754030, "text": "I can't get rid of them."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 756970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 755270, "text": "Have you tried holding your breath?"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 758609, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 757610, "text": "That works?"}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 761190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 758610, "text": "It always did for me, and it's loads of\nfun."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 763590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 761790, "text": "That's how I had my first hallucination."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 768470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 767470, "text": "Wow!"}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 769670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 768670, "text": "I'll give it a try."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 771090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 770090, "text": "How long?"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 772450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 771230, "text": "Don't worry, I'll time you."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 785720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 784720, "text": "little watch."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 788360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 786980, "text": "I got it for my birthday."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 791040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 789580, "text": "Not that I needed a watch."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 795200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 793200, "text": "I did without one for quite a while."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 800360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 797200, "text": "I used to tell time the way the ancient\nIncans did."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 803980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 802240, "text": "By asking the guy next to me."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 813440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 811220, "text": "Only five billion oscillations left."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 818440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814939, "text": "Uh, V, tell me something."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 822780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 820080, "text": "Why did you pick this particular time to\ncome back to?"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 827800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 823120, "text": "Well, we determined that the late 20th\ncentury was our last chance to turn the"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 830200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 827800, "text": "tide of lawlessness and save the future."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 834060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 830600, "text": "Gee, I don't know. I just can't believe\nthe future is as bad as you say."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 835380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 834380, "text": "Are you kidding?"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 837280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 835700, "text": "The city is under siege."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 838800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 837580, "text": "Crime is out of control."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 848130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845130, "text": "We can do it. You rush him, I'll cover\nyou with the knife."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 849810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848810, "text": "I don't know."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 851570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 850430, "text": "What about the ray gun?"}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 854010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 852410, "text": "The ray gun, the ray gun."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 857750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 856750, "text": "That's it."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 858790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857790, "text": "Time's up."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 861130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 859150, "text": "Prepare to die, scum."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 862510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861510, "text": "No!"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 863790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862790, "text": "I don't have a will."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 867590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 864270, "text": "I've never... I haven't written my\nmemoirs yet."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 872990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 868790, "text": "I've never heard a girl say, Okay, daddy\nboy, your turn."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 881810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880810, "text": "We'll give them a choice."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 883590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882390, "text": "Death or castration?"}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 887970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 886970, "text": "Death."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 893890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892770, "text": "So be it."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 897650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894110, "text": "Oh, wait, wait. You wouldn't shoot a\nwoman, would you?"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 899170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 898170, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 901570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899870, "text": "Sorry, Dan, but what made a difference?"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 904310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 903310, "text": "Right, thanks."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 911600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 904710, "text": "Enough! Now, prepare to have your\nelectron... freed from their"}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 913000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 911600, "text": "orbit. Stop!"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 914400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 913400, "text": "Now what?"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 915520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 914520, "text": "Don't do it, Leon."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 917080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 916080, "text": "Leon?"}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 923020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 917820, "text": "That's his name, Leon Mintz. VHK 937\nisn't an alias. It's a license plate. We"}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 924020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 923020, "text": "checked it at the DMV."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 926280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925280, "text": "Anything else?"}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 930640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 926700, "text": "He's 6 '2\", 240 pounds, and he's not\nsupposed to drive at night without his"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 931640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930640, "text": "glasses."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 934380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 933380, "text": "You asked."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 937100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 936100, "text": "They lie."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 938760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937480, "text": "I'm from the future."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 943230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 941230, "text": "Then why do you drive a 76 Pinto?"}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 947590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 945670, "text": "It's modified for time travel."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 950410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 948110, "text": "Why do the dorks always have the cherry\ncars?"}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 958050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 954730, "text": "First, I considered getting a job\nstuffing cardboard in the collars of new"}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 959050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 958050, "text": "shirts."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 965210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 962630, "text": "But there's probably a lot of\ncompetition for those jobs."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 971190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 970190, "text": "It's 8 .13."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 973850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 971610, "text": "And then it finally hit me."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 976510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 974290, "text": "Mothballs. There's always a demand for\nmothballs."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 978050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 977050, "text": "What do you think?"}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 986190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 984990, "text": "Oh, are you all right?"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 989230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988230, "text": "I'm fine."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 992050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 989930, "text": "But little Joe's trapped in the barn."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 999280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 996080, "text": "out of here. Oh, sorry, Harry. Didn't\nknow court was in session. Come on."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1008980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1003520, "text": "Hey, where's my knife?"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1011420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010420, "text": "Finders keepers."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1013920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012300, "text": "Now, get over here, away from that door."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1015220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014220, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1018460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1016220, "text": "All right, I am free."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1022720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1019000, "text": "They smudged my suit. All right, you put\nthat puppy on broil."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1027540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025040, "text": "I want you all where I can see you.\nWhat? Now! Go!"}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1029260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1027740, "text": "Go! You're the boss. You're the boss."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1032420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1031420, "text": "This looks bad."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1036520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1032980, "text": "Silence! Look, Leon. Why do you keep\ncalling me that?"}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1039380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1037119, "text": "Leon Mintz was a brilliant industrial\nengineer."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1041240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1039640, "text": "He invented the Yoo -Hoo suitcase."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1045359, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1043200, "text": "It had a talking handle so you could\nfind it in the airport."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1049140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1047880, "text": "Oh, that's brilliant."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1056720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1054160, "text": "Leon Mintz sounds like the kind of guy\nthe world could use."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1058360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1057200, "text": "Whatever happened to him?"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1062340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1058880, "text": "One day he was mugged on the street, and\nthen on the subway."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1066200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1062540, "text": "Then his apartment was robbed, stripped\nof everything except for a few clothes"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1067600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066200, "text": "hangers and a Robert Goulet album."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1070740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1068920, "text": "I wonder why they left the hangers."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1077380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072920, "text": "Well, Leon tired of being a victim, so\nhe decided to do something about it. I,"}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1081720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1077460, "text": "he, invented this battery -powered\nlaser."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1084140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1082960, "text": "You want to see how it works?"}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1086800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1084440, "text": "That's okay, man. I've seen it. Works\ngood."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1092380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1087820, "text": "Perfect. Look, Leon, you can't go around\njust indiscriminately sizzling people."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1094080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093080, "text": "Think about it."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1100080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1094620, "text": "What gives any person the right to\ndetermine the fate of another person's"}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1102400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1101360, "text": "Isn't that what you do?"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1105720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104680, "text": "Bad example."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1115540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1114060, "text": "Why won't you believe me?"}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1118040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1116260, "text": "Why won't anybody believe me?"}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1120040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1119040, "text": "I believe you."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1123200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1121900, "text": "Buddy, you shouldn't be here."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1124880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1123480, "text": "No, no. Let him stay."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1129280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1126420, "text": "You really believe I'm from the future?"}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1130520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1129520, "text": "Well, sure."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1133940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1130840, "text": "You look like a regular Joe who's got\nhis light bulb screwed in straight."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1137220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1134820, "text": "So, uh, what's it like in Tomorrowland?"}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1139400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1138400, "text": "It's horrible."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1141280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1139540, "text": "The forces of chaos are everywhere."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1144480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1142060, "text": "It's impossible to find even an island\nof serenity."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1146820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144920, "text": "Well, that's why I keep mine in my\npants."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1152960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1151000, "text": "Buddy, maybe you should let us."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1154160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1153160, "text": "Oh,"}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1155540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1154540, "text": "that's beautiful."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1158100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156380, "text": "I think it's Tulsa."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1163680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161120, "text": "Why are you pointing that label maker at\nthose people?"}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1166960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1164660, "text": "That's a ray gun, man. They're\ncriminals."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1170840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1167400, "text": "They must be exterminated so that people\nwon't have to live in fear."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1174890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171370, "text": "Afraid to walk to the store at night or\nuse the parks."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1177470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1176270, "text": "You know what I mean."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1179210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1178190, "text": "All too well."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1186090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1179670, "text": "You remind me of a man who was so filled\nwith rage and pain that it drove him to"}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1192350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1186090, "text": "an institution where all he could do was\nball up his fists and scream at the"}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1193350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192350, "text": "moon."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1195550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1193670, "text": "Gee, buddy, I never knew."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1197310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196310, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1199190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1198190, "text": "Weird Walt."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1203180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199740, "text": "Lived in the same ward with him for 15\nyears. Didn't get a wink of sleep."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1206180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204980, "text": "I don't understand."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1208200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1207200, "text": "Hold on."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1213160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1208340, "text": "What I'm trying to say is, okay, let\nthem take your money."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1214960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213420, "text": "Let them take your property."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1217860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1215780, "text": "But don't let them take your sanity."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1222420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220520, "text": "I'm just tired of being picked on."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1225420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223280, "text": "Stop dressing like a Jiffy Pop bag."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1236740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1230160, "text": "Next time you feel picked on, just get\naway and try thinking"}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1241240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1236740, "text": "of all the things that are beautiful in\nthe world."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1244500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1243200, "text": "Like Tulsa."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1248280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1247280, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1252900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1250800, "text": "Can I have Tulsa?"}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1259000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1254340, "text": "I don't know. I've had it for a long\ntime. Buddy?"}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1261880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1259980, "text": "Maybe you'd like to work out a trade."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1266420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1265420, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1269580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1267160, "text": "I'll trade you Tulsa for the gloves."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1276720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1274960, "text": "The gun, buddy, the gun."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1280900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1279900, "text": "Or the gun."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1285000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1284000, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1287400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1286400, "text": "There you go."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1291580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1290580, "text": "Tulsa."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1294960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1293960, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1299060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1296080, "text": "Buddy, you sure you're not going to miss\nTulsa?"}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1302480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1299780, "text": "Nah, not as long as I got Tallahassee."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1309120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1307640, "text": "Hi, boys."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1311640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309940, "text": "Can I give you a lift to holding?"}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1314720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1312400, "text": "Hey, Tiki, you're kind of cute. You got\na boyfriend?"}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1316960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1315020, "text": "Hey, man, I saw her first. I saw her."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1322740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1320400, "text": "Well, it's only 8 .19. You think I still\ngot time to get this clean and make it"}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1325140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1322740, "text": "to the dinner party? Oh, yeah, you can\nget some coffee and still have time to"}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1326560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1325140, "text": "tell a tasteless sex joke."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1327800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1326800, "text": "Luck's with me, huh?"}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1331100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1330100, "text": "Hey, buddy."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1333700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1331840, "text": "I wish time travel were possible."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1338620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1336460, "text": "Maybe I would have had a chance to meet\nGene Harlow."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1341120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1339720, "text": "Learn magic from Houdini."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1343900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1342360, "text": "Seen Mal in his first concert?"}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1345960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1344560, "text": "I'd go back to last Tuesday."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1349780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1348780, "text": "earmuffs on the subway."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1353680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1352680, "text": "Possibilities are endless."}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1356520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1354260, "text": "Your Honor, the guys from Bellevue\npicked up Mr. V."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1358260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1356820, "text": "Thank you, Bo."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1360440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1358620, "text": "Any chance I could take home this ray\ngun?"}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1362680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1361000, "text": "I got something clogging up my toilet."}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1366900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1364560, "text": "Sorry, big guy. That thing has to go\nback to evidence."}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1370660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1367640, "text": "Oh, all right. I guess I can keep on\nusing the shell station."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1384480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1382919, "text": "What? I dropped the ray gun."}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1385740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1384740, "text": "Sorry."}
